{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35819","headline":"陈正字山居 · 李咸用","name":"陈正字山居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一叶闲飞斜照里，江南仲蔚在蓬蒿。\n天衢云险驽骀蹇，月桂风和梦想劳。\n遶枕泉声秋雨细，对门山色古屏高。\n此中即是神仙地，引手何妨一钓鳌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}